# Pairs with LinkGateMatchesLinking. A link gate released mid-cascade admits a second link onto the parents.
MODULE: CascadeReleasesLinkGate
TARGET: LinkGateMatchesLinking
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the root releases its link gate as the grandparent divides
PERTURBS: GrandparentCascade

--- FIND
    /\ cascaded' = TRUE
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "cascade"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<fg, cap, cons, gate, sib, lg, seed, overflowed, linked, dep, deacts>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ cascaded' = TRUE
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "cascade"]
    \* MUTATION: the link gate is released early
    /\ lg' = "none"
    /\ UNCHANGED <<fg, cap, cons, gate, sib, seed, overflowed, linked, dep, deacts>>
--- END
